Wedding · 모바일 청첩장 빌더
============================

This project incorporates design principles studied from:

- nexu-io/open-design (https://github.com/nexu-io/open-design)
  Apache License 2.0
  Specifically the warm-editorial DESIGN.md provided guidance on
  typography scale, top-biased hero composition, accent discipline,
  off-white tonal foundations, and motion timing.
  All implementation code is original.

Wedding invitation structure (countdown, gallery, account copy,
guestbook, RSVP) follows widespread industry patterns common to
Korean mobile wedding invitations. No code was copied from any
specific wedding invitation template repository.
